<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TrabajaYa | Inteligencia Artificial para la Empleabilidad</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Google Identity Services (OAuth Popup) -->
    <script src="https://accounts.google.com/gsi/client" async defer></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #060913;
            --surface: #0d1322;
            --card-bg: rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.85);
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --border-highlight: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.35);
            --primary: #8b5cf6;
            --secondary: #a855f7;
            --accent: #38bdf8;
            --gradient-brand: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7 0%, #6366f1 50%, #38bdf8 100%);
            --gradient-gold: linear-gradient(135deg, #fbbf24 0%, #f59e0b 50%, #d97706 100%);
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --text-sub: #64748b;
            --success: #10b981;
            --danger: #ef4444;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
        }

        #canvas3d {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100vw;
            height: 100vh;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.65;
        }

        .ambient-orb {
            position: fixed;
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            filter: blur(140px);
            z-index: 1;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.25;
        }
        .orb-1 { top: -100px; left: -100px; background: #6d28d9; }
        .orb-2 { bottom: -150px; right: -100px; background: #0284c7; }

        header {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(6, 9, 19, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .navbar {
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .nav-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.85rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .brand-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .brand-text {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .brand-text .gradient {
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .btn-nav-toggle-left {
            display: none;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            color: #cbd5e1;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .btn-nav-toggle-left:hover {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--secondary);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .nav-center {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .nav-menu-public {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            list-style: none;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: nowrap;
        }

        .nav-item {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            user-select: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .nav-item:hover { color: #fff; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
        .nav-item.active {
            color: #fff;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .app-tool-selector {
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            background: rgba(13, 19, 34, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.35rem;
        }

        .tool-tab-btn {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
            white-space: nowrap;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .tool-tab-btn:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        }
        .tool-tab-btn.active {
            color: #fff;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.22);
            border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.45);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
        }

        .nav-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        #unauthNav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.6rem;
        }

        #authNav {
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .btn-auth-outline {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.84rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .btn-auth-outline:hover {
            border-color: var(--secondary);
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1);
        }

        .btn-auth-solid {
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            border: none;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 0.45rem 1.15rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.84rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .btn-auth-solid:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5);
        }

        .coin-badge {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
            background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
            color: #fbbf24;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            user-select: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .coin-badge:hover {
            background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.22);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
        }

        .pro-badge {
            background: var(--gradient-gold);
            color: #000;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .user-pill {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.45rem;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem 0.3rem 0.35rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .user-pill:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
        }

        .avatar-dot {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fff;
        }

        /* DROPDOWN MENU AL DAR CLIC EN EL NOMBRE */
        .user-dropdown-menu {
            position: absolute;
            top: calc(100% + 8px);
            right: 0;
            width: 260px;
            background: #0d1322;
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            z-index: 1050;
            animation: flyoutSlideUp 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }
        .user-dd-header {
            padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.25rem;
        }
        .user-dd-divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }
        .user-dd-item {
            width: 100%;
            background: transparent;
            border: none;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            padding: 0.55rem 0.7rem;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.15s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .user-dd-item:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            color: #fff;
        }
        .user-dd-item.danger {
            color: #f87171;
        }
        .user-dd-item.danger:hover {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
            color: #fca5a5;
        }

        /* VIEWPORT & PANES */
        .app-viewport {
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 3.5rem;
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .view-pane {
            display: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(6px);
            transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
        }
        .view-pane.active-pane {
            display: block;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        /* HERO INICIO */
        .hero-banner {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 1.5rem auto 3.5rem;
        }

        .tag-pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
            border-radius: 9999px;
            color: #c084fc;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .green-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--success);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--success);
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .hero-title .highlight {
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .hero-desc {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .metrics-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1.25rem;
            margin: 2.5rem 0 3.5rem;
        }
        @media (max-width: 900px) { .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
        @media (max-width: 520px) { .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

        .metric-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
            text-align: center;
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }
        .metric-val {
            font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
        }
        .metric-title { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
        .metric-desc { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

        /* PRECIOS EN INICIO */
        .pricing-section-home {
            margin-top: 4.5rem;
            padding-top: 2.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        }
        .pricing-home-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
        }
        @media (max-width: 960px) { .pricing-home-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

        .price-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.2rem 1.8rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .price-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4); }
        .price-card.featured {
            border-color: var(--secondary);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22, 32, 54, 0.95) 0%, rgba(13, 20, 36, 0.95) 100%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
        }
        .price-badge-top {
            position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: var(--gradient-brand); color: #fff; padding: 0.2rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .p-name { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; color: #fff; }
        .p-amount {
            font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; font-size: 2.3rem; font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.25rem; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.35rem; color: #fff;
        }
        .p-amount span { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; }
        .p-list {
            list-style: none; margin: 1.25rem 0 1.75rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; flex-grow: 1;
        }
        .p-list li { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #cbd5e1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }

        /* VISTA ACERCA DE */
        .about-section { max-width: 1000px; margin: 1rem auto; }
        .about-card {
            background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.5rem; backdrop-filter: blur(16px); margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
            gap: 1.25rem;
            margin-top: 1.75rem;
        }
        .team-member {
            grid-column: span 2;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            min-height: 84px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .team-grid .team-member:nth-child(4) {
            grid-column: 2 / span 2;
        }
        .team-grid .team-member:nth-child(5) {
            grid-column: 4 / span 2;
        }
        .team-member:hover {
            border-color: var(--secondary);
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .member-initials {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.4), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4));
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .member-info {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .member-name {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }
        .member-role {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--accent);
            line-height: 1.35;
        }

        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .team-grid {
                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .team-grid .team-member {
                flex: 1 1 270px;
                max-width: 340px;
                grid-column: auto !important;
            }
        }

        /* FAQ */
        .faq-section { max-width: 880px; margin: 1rem auto; }
        .faq-accordion { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
        .faq-item {
            background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color 0.2s;
        }
        .faq-item:hover { border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35); }
        .faq-question {
            padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;
            display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; user-select: none;
        }
        .faq-icon { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--secondary); transition: transform 0.25s; }
        .faq-answer {
            max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; padding: 0 1.5rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem;
            line-height: 1.6; transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s;
        }
        .faq-item.open .faq-answer { max-height: 300px; padding: 0 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
        .faq-item.open .faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }

        /* CONTACTO */
        .contact-section {
            max-width: 580px; margin: 2rem auto;
        }
        .contact-form-box {
            background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; padding: 2.25rem; backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        }
        .input-field {
            width: 100%; background: rgba(6, 9, 19, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-radius: 10px; padding: 0.85rem 1rem; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }
        .input-field:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--secondary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2); }

        /* WORKSPACE HERRAMIENTAS */
        .app-container {
            max-width: 1240px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .module-pane {
            display: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(8px);
            transition: opacity 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;
        }
        .module-pane.active-module {
            display: block;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .module-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.2rem;
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .module-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        .module-header h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }

        .dropzone {
            border: 2px dashed rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
            border-radius: 14px; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; text-align: center;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.04); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .dropzone:hover { border-color: var(--secondary); background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); }
        .dropzone input { display: none; }

        .tag-pill-ok {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);
            color: #6ee7b7; padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;
        }
        .tag-pill-miss {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);
            color: #fca5a5; padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* ------------------------------------------- */
        /* REDISEÑO 2-COLUMNAS PARA ADAPTAR CV 🚀      */
        /* ------------------------------------------- */
        .adaptar-two-col {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: start;
        }
        @media (max-width: 960px) {
            .adaptar-two-col {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        /* SELECTOR DE ESTILOS DE CV (ATS VS FORMAL) */
        .style-selector-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 0.85rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }
        .style-card-option {
            background: rgba(13, 19, 34, 0.85);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            user-select: none;
            position: relative;
        }
        .style-card-option:hover {
            border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06);
        }
        .style-card-option.selected {
            border-color: var(--secondary);
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25);
        }
        .style-card-badge {
            position: absolute;
            top: 8px;
            right: 8px;
            background: var(--secondary);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            display: none;
        }
        .style-card-option.selected .style-card-badge {
            display: block;
        }

        /* HOJA A4 PREVIEW EN VIVO */
        .a4-preview-sheet {
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #0f172a;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 2.2rem 2.4rem;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            margin-top: 1.25rem;
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            min-height: 480px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-ats h1 {
            font-size: 1.55rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #000;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-ats h2 {
            font-size: 0.92rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #111;
            margin: 1.2rem 0 0.4rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #444;
            padding-bottom: 0.15rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-ats p, 
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-ats li {
            font-size: 0.86rem;
            color: #1f2937;
        }
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-ats ul {
            margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem 1.4rem;
            padding: 0;
        }

        /* FORMAL STYLE */
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-formal {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-formal h1 {
            font-size: 1.65rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
        }
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-formal h2 {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #312e81;
            margin: 1.2rem 0 0.45rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #6366f1;
            padding-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-formal p,
        .a4-preview-sheet .cv-style-formal li {
            font-size: 0.86rem;
            color: #334155;
        }
        .cv-skills-cloud {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            margin-top: 0.35rem;
        }
        .cv-skill-item {
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1e293b;
            background: #f1f5f9;
            padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* ESTILOS EDITOR INTERACTIVO TIPO WORD */
        .cv-editor-toolbar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            background: #111827;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-bottom: none;
            border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
            padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem;
            margin-top: 1.25rem;
        }
        .editor-tool-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.15s ease;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
        }
        .editor-tool-btn:hover {
            background: var(--secondary);
            color: #fff;
            border-color: var(--secondary);
        }
        .editor-tool-btn.active {
            background: var(--secondary);
            color: #fff;
        }
        .a4-preview-sheet.editing-mode {
            border: 2px dashed rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.6);
            outline: none;
            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
            margin-top: 0;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
        }

        /* TARJETAS DE BRECHAS DETECTADAS */
        .brecha-item-card {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
        }

        /* WIDGET FLOTANTE DE TICKET EN LA ESQUINA 👑 */
        .support-fab {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 95px;
            right: 28px;
            z-index: 9999;
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 9999px;
            padding: 0.65rem 1.15rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.86rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.45);
            transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            user-select: none;
        }
        .support-fab:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.03);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.65);
        }
        .support-fab.pro-glow {
            background: var(--gradient-gold);
            color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
        }
        .support-fab-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #10b981;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10b981;
        }

        /* FLYOUT / MENUSITO DEL TICKET */
        .support-flyout {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 155px;
            right: 28px;
            width: 360px;
            max-width: calc(100vw - 32px);
            background: #0d1322;
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            z-index: 10000;
            display: none;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            animation: flyoutSlideUp 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        @keyframes flyoutSlideUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .support-flyout-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25), rgba(6, 9, 19, 0.9));
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .support-flyout-body {
            padding: 1.25rem;
            background: #090d1a;
        }

        /* MODAL DIALOGS */
        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); z-index: 1000;
            display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 1.5rem;
        }
        .modal-card {
            background: #0d1322; border: 1px solid var(--border-highlight); border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 2.5rem; width: 100%; max-width: 480px; position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        }
        .close-btn {
            position: absolute; top: 1.25rem; right: 1.25rem; background: transparent;
            border: none; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.5rem; cursor: pointer;
        }
        .close-btn:hover { color: #fff; }

        .modal-tab-group {
            display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            padding: 0.3rem; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .modal-tab {
            flex: 1; padding: 0.6rem; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-muted); cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none;
        }
        .modal-tab.active { background: var(--secondary); color: #fff; }

        .legal-link {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .legal-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); background: #03060d; padding: 2rem 0;
            position: relative; z-index: 20; margin-top: auto;
        }
        .footer-inner {
            max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-sub);
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE DESIGN */
        @media (max-width: 820px) {
            .navbar { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
            .nav-center { order: 3; width: 100%; justify-content: center; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
            .app-tool-selector { flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <canvas id="canvas3d"></canvas>
    <div class="ambient-orb orb-1"></div>
    <div class="ambient-orb orb-2"></div>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header>
        <div class="navbar">
            
            <!-- 1. LADO IZQUIERDO: LOGO + BOTÓN VER SITIO A LA IZQUIERDA -->
            <div class="nav-left">
                <div class="brand-container" onclick="clickLogoBrand()">
                    <div class="brand-logo">⚡</div>
                    <div class="brand-text">Trabaja<span class="gradient">Ya</span></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Botón situado a la izquierda para no estorbar a la derecha -->
                <button class="btn-nav-toggle-left" id="btnToggleVistaLeft" onclick="toggleVistaLandingApp()">
                    <span id="txtBtnToggleVista">🌐 Ver Sitio</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. CENTRO: MENÚ PÚBLICO O SELECTOR DE MÓDULOS CON ICONOS -->
            <div class="nav-center">
                <!-- En Modo Landing: enlaces estándar de navegación -->
                <ul class="nav-menu-public" id="publicNavMenu">
                    <li><span class="nav-item active" id="nav-inicio" onclick="mostrarVista('inicio')">Inicio</span></li>
                    <li><span class="nav-item" id="nav-acerca" onclick="mostrarVista('acerca')">Acerca de</span></li>
                    <li><span class="nav-item" id="nav-faq" onclick="mostrarVista('faq')">Preguntas Frecuentes</span></li>
                    <li><span class="nav-item" id="nav-contacto" onclick="mostrarVista('contacto')">Contáctenos</span></li>
                </ul>

                <!-- En Modo Herramienta: Selector adaptativo según ROL -->
                <div class="app-tool-selector" id="appToolSelector">
                    <!-- BOTONES CANDIDATO (rol === 'candidato') -->
                    <div id="navGroupCandidato" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;">
                        <button class="tool-tab-btn active" id="btnTool-muro" onclick="seleccionarHerramienta('muro')" title="Muro de Vacantes Activas">
                            <span>💼</span>
                            <span>Muro de Empleos</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-tab-btn" id="btnTool-expediente" onclick="seleccionarHerramienta('expediente')" title="Expediente Maestro Permanente">
                            <span>📄</span>
                            <span>Expediente</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-tab-btn" id="btnTool-adaptar" onclick="seleccionarHerramienta('adaptar')" title="Adaptar CV con IA">
                            <span>🎯</span>
                            <span>Adaptar CV</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-tab-btn" id="btnTool-entrevistas" onclick="seleccionarHerramienta('entrevistas')" title="Simulador de Entrevistas">
                            <span>🎙️</span>
                            <span>Entrevistas IA</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-tab-btn" id="btnTool-mis-postulaciones" onclick="seleccionarHerramienta('mis-postulaciones')" title="Estado de mis postulaciones">
                            <span>📂</span>
                            <span>Mis Postulaciones</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- BOTONES RECLUTADOR (rol === 'reclutador') -->
                    <div id="navGroupReclutador" style="display: none; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem;">
                        <button class="tool-tab-btn active" id="btnTool-reclutador-vacantes" onclick="seleccionarHerramienta('reclutador-vacantes')" title="Gestión y Publicación de Vacantes">
                            <span>💼</span>
                            <span>Mis Vacantes & Muro</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-tab-btn" id="btnTool-reclutador-metricas" onclick="seleccionarHerramienta('reclutador-metricas')" title="Métricas y Estadísticas del Proceso">
                            <span>📊</span>
                            <span>Métricas & Panel</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-tab-btn" id="btnTool-reclutador-candidatos-tab" onclick="seleccionarHerramienta('reclutador-candidatos-tab')" title="Bandeja de Postulantes & Respuestas Seguras">
                            <span>👥</span>
                            <span>Postulantes & Dictamen IA</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. LADO DERECHO: LIMPIO (MONEDAS + PERFIL + MENÚ DESPLEGABLE) -->
            <div class="nav-right">
                <!-- No autenticado -->
                <div id="unauthNav">
                    <button class="btn-auth-outline" onclick="abrirModal('login')">Iniciar Sesión</button>
                    <button class="btn-auth-solid" onclick="abrirModal('register')">Registrar</button>
                </div>

                <!-- Autenticado -->
                <div id="authNav">
                    <div id="coinBadge" class="coin-badge" onclick="abrirModalPacks()" title="Monedas disponibles">
                        ⚡ 2 TC
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Píldora de usuario con menú desplegable -->
                    <div style="position: relative;">
                        <div class="user-pill" onclick="toggleUserDropdown(event)" title="Opciones de cuenta">
                            <div class="avatar-dot" id="userInitial">U</div>
                            <span id="userNameHeader">Usuario</span>
                            <span style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 2px;">▼</span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Dropdown flotante con opción de borrar expediente -->
                        <div id="userDropdownMenu" class="user-dropdown-menu" style="display: none;">
                            <div class="user-dd-header">
                                <strong id="ddUserName" style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: #fff;">Usuario</strong>
                                <span id="ddUserEmail" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">correo@ejemplo.com</span>
                                <span id="ddUserPlan" style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: #fde047; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.2rem;">Plan PRO</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="user-dd-divider"></div>
                            
                            <div id="userDdExpedienteSection">
                                <div style="padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
                                    <span>Expediente:</span>
                                    <span id="ddExpedienteBadge" style="font-weight: 700; color: #10b981;">Sincronizado</span>
                                </div>

                                <button class="user-dd-item danger" id="btnDdBorrarExpediente" onclick="confirmarBorrarExpediente()">
                                    <span>🗑️</span>
                                    <span>Borrar Expediente Maestro</span>
                                </button>
                                
                                <div class="user-dd-divider"></div>
                            </div>

                            <button class="user-dd-item" onclick="cerrarSesion()">
                                <span>🚪</span>
                                <span>Cerrar Sesión</span>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Viewport -->
    <main class="app-viewport">
        
        <!-- ============================================== -->
        <!-- VISTA 1: INICIO (PITCH + MÉTRICAS + PRECIOS)   -->
        <!-- ============================================== -->
        <section id="vista-inicio" class="view-pane active-pane">
            <div class="hero-banner">
                <div class="tag-pill">
                    <span class="green-dot"></span>
                    <span>Seminario de Tecnologías UMG 2026 • Innovación & Empleabilidad</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="hero-title">
                    Supera los Filtros ATS con tu <span class="highlight">Expediente Maestro</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="hero-desc">
                    El 75% de los currículums son descartados automáticamente por sistemas ATS antes de llegar a un humano. 
                    Nuestra IA analiza tu Expediente Maestro permanente, detecta brechas con la vacante y genera tu CV en formato estándar optimizado.
                </p>
                
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <button class="btn-auth-solid" style="padding: 0.9rem 2rem; font-size: 1rem;" onclick="irALaHerramienta()">
                        🚀 Acceder al Workspace
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn-auth-outline" style="padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem; font-size: 1rem;" onclick="mostrarVista('acerca')">
                        Conocer el Proyecto
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Métricas Clave -->
            <div class="metrics-grid">
                <div class="metric-card">
                    <div class="metric-val">87%</div>
                    <div class="metric-title">Más Entrevistas</div>
                    <div class="metric-desc">Alineando palabras clave exactas de la oferta.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-card">
                    <div class="metric-val">&lt; 3s</div>
                    <div class="metric-title">Inferencia Ultrarrápida</div>
                    <div class="metric-desc">Potenciado por Gemini 3.6 Flash con OCR visual.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-card">
                    <div class="metric-val">100%</div>
                    <div class="metric-title">Anti-Alucinaciones</div>
                    <div class="metric-desc">Nunca inventa títulos ni experiencia inexistente.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="metric-card">
                    <div class="metric-val">0 Días</div>
                    <div class="metric-title">Vencimiento Monedas</div>
                    <div class="metric-desc">Tus TrabajaCoins son tuyas para siempre.</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Sección de Precios y Packs -->
            <div class="pricing-section-home">
                <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
                    <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px;">Planes y TrabajaCoins</h2>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
                        Paga solo por lo que usas sin suscripciones forzosas, o desbloquea el plan ilimitado con soporte prioritario.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="pricing-home-grid">
                    <!-- Pack Básico -->
                    <div class="price-card">
                        <div class="p-name">Pack Esencial</div>
                        <div class="p-amount">Q20 <span>/ 5 adaptaciones</span></div>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Q4.00 por adaptación de CV</p>
                        <ul class="p-list">
                            <li>⚡ <strong>5 TrabajaCoins</strong> directas</li>
                            <li>✓ Sin fecha de caducidad</li>
                            <li>✓ Optimización ATS con Gemini 3.6 Flash</li>
                            <li>✓ Simulador de entrevistas estándar</li>
                        </ul>
                        <button class="btn-auth-outline" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem;" onclick="gestionarCompraInicio('pack_5', 'Q20')">Comprar Pack</button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Pack Recomendado -->
                    <div class="price-card featured">
                        <div class="price-badge-top">Más Popular</div>
                        <div class="p-name">Pack Profesional</div>
                        <div class="p-amount">Q50 <span>/ 15 adaptaciones</span></div>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent);">Q3.33 por adaptación (Ahorras 17%)</p>
                        <ul class="p-list">
                            <li>⚡ <strong>15 TrabajaCoins</strong> sin vencimiento</li>
                            <li>✓ Formato ATS y Formal Ejecutivo</li>
                            <li>✓ Auditoría de brechas curriculares</li>
                            <li>✓ Descarga en PDF de alta fidelidad</li>
                        </ul>
                        <button class="btn-auth-solid" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem;" onclick="gestionarCompraInicio('pack_15', 'Q50')">Comprar Pack Profesional</button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Plan PRO Ilimitado -->
                    <div class="price-card">
                        <div class="p-name" style="color: #fde047;">👑 Plan PRO Ilimitado</div>
                        <div class="p-amount">Q69 <span>/ mes</span></div>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #fde047;">Uso Ilimitado + Cero Anuncios</p>
                        <ul class="p-list">
                            <li>👑 <strong>Adaptaciones Ilimitadas</strong> con IA</li>
                            <li>⚡ Prioridad máxima en servidores de inferencia</li>
                            <li>🎧 Soporte VIP 24/7 (respuesta &lt; 2h)</li>
                            <li>🎙️ Simulador de entrevistas STAR ilimitado</li>
                        </ul>
                        <button class="btn-auth-solid" style="width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; background: var(--gradient-gold); color: #000; font-weight: 800;" onclick="gestionarProInicio()">Suscribirme a PRO</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ============================================== -->
        <!-- VISTA 2: ACERCA DE (AUTORES UMG Y PROYECTO)    -->
        <!-- ============================================== -->
        <section id="vista-acerca" class="view-pane">
            <div class="about-section">
                <div class="about-card">
                    <span class="tag-pill">Proyecto Académico • UMG 2026</span>
                    <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;">Seminario de Tecnologías de Información</h2>
                    <p style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                        <strong>TrabajaYa</strong> fue desarrollado como parte del Seminario de Graduación de la 
                        <strong>Universidad Mariano Gálvez de Guatemala</strong> (Campus El Naranjo). Su propósito es 
                        democratizar el acceso a herramientas de alta ingeniería que eleven la tasa de inserción 
                        laboral de profesionales en Guatemala y Centroamérica ante los modernos filtros de reclutamiento algorítmico (ATS).
                    </p>

                    <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-top: 2rem;">Equipo de Autores & Desarrolladores:</h3>
                    <div class="team-grid">
                        <div class="team-member">
                            <div class="member-initials">📋</div>
                            <div class="member-info">
                                <div class="member-name">Nery</div>
                                <div class="member-role">Scrum Master / Project Manager</div>
